{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e726065ef579b203348ec2f2b5daa7bc6edc6f84bf6bf2db02e8bac8c39d5630",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3893a05783cd762c322f22a6eb0312752ca1f7bb10888431171b677e35d6bea",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー酱？\n要是手头有空的话，能来休息室一趟吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62a3e713f13c252452c90a0003af6e8df6b7db6b60f36a41f4d1260909358f2e",
      "text": "好的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e4511c79dd301bd751212ca916d4ecb6803d0f2fe2fe7f710a166e18d934922",
      "text": "没问题",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f8bd4a26574f61cb9739969c5b039f9f5350f6b1c267e31d48d95cea642cb26",
      "text": "谢谢！其实现在这儿\n变得挺有意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7508455e8e8a932ce3a9fb0e29eb028672c7ecd0e7812830e94d336b3a238a26",
      "text": "刚才彩排的时候，四季酱的表情\n不是非常棒吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5ddf3f1dd6d630d7aa897e22eb25100a1331549cdb996882222ed6e6e4edeaf",
      "text": "以此为契机，大家就聊起来，说要多研究一下\n适合这次布景的表情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f59ecc1f9f09e15e7612db01ca51c8a6e1343eb355aee23d3239cf0d27c01dad",
      "text": "所以想请制作人酱来评判一下，\n哪个表情最符合概念设定。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9f9dc28031b422372b880e6bb67896671f74c60dc6d47b56c2b9cef073b1721",
      "text": "话虽如此……呵呵。大家齐刷刷地对着镜子\n较劲的模样，还真是相当壮观呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5331779fb53af3d1870e3a1cf04ceb7a01a1c10a83cf4a8e3703b1533b32d48e",
      "text": "总觉得有点滑稽。\n啊，当然表情本身全都很帅气哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75cdc1871a7e91eb674a72fdf69426cf847f6cf6c53d8a194415a9322c12bd55",
      "text": "大家都很放松呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:591ff6407f1397eaa41413941937a1b65e821624fe5a6d5828d416ffb7649797",
      "text": "是啊。我觉得大家都恰到好处地卸下了力道。\n当然我也一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9386272fc2333b7784888090c4afc74b5b543a4f6bd1477b7ac2a34c03c9b18",
      "text": "照这样看来，访谈和演唱会应该都能\n在很好的氛围中完成录制吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_b:2_4_018_02_09_b:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e36e9152bd108b9d089bb1edac8d1db91060c1b747c51a161d7d90506fa28f56",
      "text": "那我就在休息室等你啰。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
